+# API Contract: Takoboto-Class Dictionary & Kanji Endpoints (Phase 14.4F)
+
+## 1. Base URL & Protocol
+- **Base Protocol**: HTTPS / HTTP/1.1
+- **Base Prefix**: `/api/`
+- **Default Format**: `application/json; charset=utf-8`
+
+---
+
+## 2. Endpoints Specification
+
+### 2.1 Dictionary Search
+- **Paths**: `GET /api/dictionary`, `GET /api/dictionary/search`
+- **Query Parameters**:
+  | Param | Type | Default | Description | Constraints |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|
+  | `q` | `string` | `""` | Search query (Kanji, Kana, Romaji, English) | Max 100 characters |
+  | `limit` | `integer` | `20` | Max entries per page | 1 .. 100 (clamped) |
+  | `offset` | `integer` | `0` | Starting index | >= 0 (clamped) |
+  | `jlpt` | `string` | `undefined` | Scoped JLPT level | `N5`, `N4`, `N3`, `N2`, `N1` |
+  | `common` | `boolean` | `false` | Scoped to common words | `true` or `false` |
+  | `format` | `string` | `standard` | Output format mode | `mobile` or `standard` |
+
+- **Response (Standard - 200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "entries": [
+      {
+        "id": "de-taberu",
+        "headword": "食べる",
+        "reading": "たべる",
+        "romaji": "taberu",
+        "primaryMeaning": "to eat",
+        "meanings": ["to eat"],
+        "partsOfSpeech": ["v1", "vt"],
+        "jlptLevel": "N5",
+        "common": true,
+        "tags": ["common", "jlpt-n5"]
+      }
+    ],
+    "total": 1,
+    "limit": 20,
+    "offset": 0,
+    "hasMore": false
+  }
+  ```
+
+- **Response (Mobile Format - 200 OK - `format=mobile`)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "entries": [
+      {
+        "id": "de-taberu",
+        "headword": "食べる",
+        "reading": "たべる",
+        "romaji": "taberu",
+        "primaryMeaning": "to eat",
+        "jlptLevel": "N5",
+        "common": true,
+        "kanjiCharacters": ["食"]
+      }
+    ],
+    "total": 1,
+    "page": 1,
+    "pageSize": 20,
+    "hasMore": false
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+### 2.2 Vocabulary Entry Detail
+- **Paths**: `GET /api/dictionary/[id]`, `GET /api/dictionary/entry/[id]`
+- **Route Parameters**:
+  - `id` (`string`, required): Canonical dictionary entry ID (e.g. `de-taberu` or numeric ID).
+- **Query Parameters**:
+  - `format` (`string`, optional): Set to `mobile` for mobile-optimized payload.
+- **Response (Standard - 200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "entry": {
+      "id": "de-taberu",
+      "headword": "食べる",
+      "reading": "たべる",
+      "romaji": "taberu",
+      "jlptLevel": "N5",
+      "common": true,
+      "senses": [
+        {
+          "index": 1,
+          "partsOfSpeech": ["v1", "vt"],
+          "glosses": ["to eat"]
+        }
+      ],
+      "entityTranslations": [
+        {
+          "locale": "es",
+          "translatedGloss": "comer",
+          "isVerified": true
+        }
+      ],
+      "keigo": {
+        "honorific": "召し上がる",
+        "humble": "いただく",
+        "polite": "食べます"
+      },
+      "relatedVocabulary": [
+        {
+          "id": "de-shokuji",
+          "headword": "食事",
+          "reading": "しょくじ",
+          "primaryMeaning": "meal"
+        }
+      ]
+    }
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+### 2.3 Kanji Intelligence Detail
+- **Path**: `GET /api/kanji/[character]`
+- **Route Parameters**:
+  - `character` (`string`, required): Single kanji glyph (e.g. `食`, `箸`).
+- **Response (200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "kanji": {
+      "id": "ke-shoku",
+      "character": "食",
+      "meaning": "eat, food",
+      "meanings": ["eat", "food"],
+      "onyomi": ["ショク", "ジキ"],
+      "kunyomi": ["く.う", "く.らう", "た.べる", "は.む"],
+      "nanori": [],
+      "strokeCount": 9,
+      "visualStrokeCount": 9,
+      "hasDiscrepancy": false,
+      "grade": 2,
+      "jlptLevel": "N5",
+      "frequency": 341,
+      "radical": "食"
+    },
+    "visual": {
+      "hasVisualAsset": true,
+      "staticDiagramSvg": "<svg ...>...</svg>",
+      "animatedSvg": "<svg ...><style>...</style>...</svg>",
+      "strokeCount": 9,
+      "visualStrokeCount": 9,
+      "hasDiscrepancy": false,
+      "discrepancyNote": null
+    },
+    "readings": {
+      "onyomi": ["ショク", "ジキ"],
+      "kunyomi": ["く.う", "く.らう", "た.べる", "は.む"],
+      "nanori": [],
+      "specialReadings": []
+    },
+    "radical": {
+      "character": "食",
+      "radicalNumber": 184,
+      "meaning": "eat, food",
+      "strokeCount": 9
+    },
+    "components": [],
+    "mindTree": {
+      "id": "mt-shoku",
+      "rootKanji": "食",
+      "totalCompounds": 45,
+      "jlptBreakdown": { "n5": 5, "n4": 8, "n3": 12, "n2": 15, "n1": 5 }
+    }
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+### 2.4 Kanji Vocabulary Explorer
+- **Path**: `GET /api/kanji/[character]/vocabulary`
+- **Route Parameters**:
+  - `character` (`string`, required): Single kanji glyph.
+- **Query Parameters**:
+  | Param | Type | Default | Description |
+  |---|---|---|---|
+  | `reading` | `string` | `undefined` | Scoped reading filter (e.g. `ショク`) |
+  | `level` | `string` | `undefined` | JLPT level filter (`N5`..`N1`) |
+  | `position`| `string` | `undefined` | Position in word (`prefix`, `middle`, `suffix`) |
+  | `limit` | `integer` | `50` | Max compounds to return (1..100) |
+  | `offset` | `integer` | `0` | Compound offset |
+
+- **Response (200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "character": "食",
+    "total": 45,
+    "limit": 50,
+    "offset": 0,
+    "vocabulary": [
+      {
+        "id": "de-taberu",
+        "headword": "食べる",
+        "reading": "たべる",
+        "primaryMeaning": "to eat",
+        "jlptLevel": "N5",
+        "position": "prefix",
+        "kanjiReading": "た.べる"
+      }
+    ]
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+### 2.5 Kanji Reading Taxonomy
+- **Path**: `GET /api/kanji/[character]/readings`
+- **Route Parameters**:
+  - `character` (`string`, required): Single kanji glyph.
+- **Response (200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "character": "食",
+    "onyomi": ["ショク", "ジキ"],
+    "kunyomi": ["く.う", "く.らう", "た.べる", "は.む"],
+    "nanori": [],
+    "specialReadings": []
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+### 2.6 Kanji Structural Components
+- **Path**: `GET /api/kanji/[character]/components`
+- **Route Parameters**:
+  - `character` (`string`, required): Single kanji glyph.
+- **Response (200 OK)**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "character": "明",
+    "radical": {
+      "character": "日",
+      "radicalNumber": 72,
+      "meaning": "sun, day",
+      "strokeCount": 4
+    },
+    "components": [
+      { "character": "日", "meaning": "sun, day", "strokeCount": 4 },
+      { "character": "月", "meaning": "moon, month", "strokeCount": 4 }
+    ]
+  }
+  ```
+
+---
+
+## 3. Error Handling & Standard Error Codes
+
+All API endpoints return standard HTTP status codes and JSON error responses:
+```json
+{
+  "error": "Error description message"
+}
+```
+
+| HTTP Status | Error Reason |
+|---|---|
+| `400 Bad Request` | Missing required parameter or invalid character length (> 1 for kanji routes) |
+| `404 Not Found` | Kanji glyph or dictionary entry ID does not exist in the database |
+| `500 Internal Error` | Database or unhandled runtime fault (sanitized, zero leaked stack traces) |
