+4. **Radicals & Primitives:** Character is enforced unique by `kanji_radicals.character` UNIQUE.
+5. **Grammar Patterns:** URL-safe kebab-case slug is enforced unique by `grammar_patterns.slug` UNIQUE (`gp-${slug}`).
