+## 1. Existing Sentence Schema
+
+The canonical schema for example sentences is defined in `src/db/schema.ts` (lines 750–765) as:
+
+```ts
+export const exampleSentences = pgTable("example_sentences", {
+  id: text("id").primaryKey(),
+  japanese: text("japanese").notNull(),
+  reading: text("reading").notNull(),
+  english: text("english").notNull(),
+  jlptLevel: text("jlpt_level").notNull(),
+  grammarId: text("grammar_id"),
+  dictionaryEntryIds: jsonb("dictionary_entry_ids").default([]).notNull().$type<string[]>(),
+  kanjiCharacters: jsonb("kanji_characters").default([]).notNull().$type<string[]>(),
+  tags: jsonb("tags").default([]).notNull().$type<string[]>(),
+  sourceRef: text("source_ref").notNull(),
+});
+```
+
+### Key Schema Characteristics
+- **Primary Key**: String `id` following the deterministic pattern `es-tat-<tatoebaId>` or `es-firstparty-...`.
+- **Textual Fields**: `japanese` (full sentence text), `reading` (full kana representation), and `english` (aligned primary translation).
+- **Relational Arrays**: `dictionaryEntryIds` (JSON array of `dictionary_entries.id`), `kanjiCharacters` (JSON array of unique kanji characters extracted from the sentence).
+- **Classification**: `jlptLevel` (N5..N1 or NONE), `tags` (thematic and functional category tags).
+- **Provenance Link**: `sourceRef` referencing `knowledge_sources.id`.
+
+Current database row count:
+- Total: 50 records (24 `first-party:sentences-core:v1`, 25 `tatoeba:corpus:2024-07`, 1 `first-party:test:v1`).
+
+---
+
+## 2. Existing Sentence ETL
