+- `pipeline.ts`: `SentencePipeline.run(options)` parses, validates, and loads sentence batches.
+- `transformer.ts`: `transformSentenceEntry(raw, sourceRef)` cleans text via Unicode NFKC, extracts kanji, matches dictionary entries, matches grammar patterns, and validates non-empty strings.
+- `loader.ts`: `SentenceLoader` provides idempotent database batch loading and registration of the source in `knowledge_sources`.
+- `matcher.ts`: In-memory keyword/trie matcher connecting sentence substrings to dictionary entries and grammar patterns.
+- `pilotData.ts`: Curated 25-record pilot fixture from the Tatoeba corpus with verified Japanese and English translations.
+- `types.ts`: Interface definitions for raw records, canonical records, and constant `TATOEBA_SOURCE_REF = "tatoeba:corpus:2024-07"`.
