+
+1. **`ProvenanceService`**: Source registration, format validation, assert-ingestible gate, and dry-run manifest creation.
+2. **`SentenceMatcher`**: High-performance in-memory lexical matcher against canonical kanji and dictionary entries.
+3. **`extractKanjiCharacters`**: Canonical regex-based kanji extraction utility.
