+/**
+ * Phase 14.5A — Tatoeba Sentence Acquisition & Provenance Foundation Tests.
+ *
+ * Implements 34 focused test scenarios covering:
+ * - Source registration and provenance verification
+ * - Local artifact integrity and path security
+ * - Parser line streaming and format handling
+ * - Japanese text normalization and script analysis
+ * - Deterministic sentence identity
+ * - Provenance attachment and legal compliance
+ * - Quality validation and warning taxonomy
+ * - Relational link preservation (1:1, 1:N, N:1, 0:N)
+ * - Dry-run database safety locks
+ * - Deterministic digest reproducibility
+ */
+
